(1998.550,'1998-12-14','1998-12-14','EPSG','Add concatenated transformation area of use field','Geod_trf','','This field is for concatenated (multi-step) transformations only. For single step transformations the area of use for the related polynomial or non-polynomial transformation apply to the geodetic transformation.','New field added.  Remarks and information source field captions changed to include "concatenated".'),
