(2004.331,'2004-10-16','2004-10-16','EPSG','Add geographic CRS derived information','Coordinate Reference System','4931-4993 even numbers only; 4130 4148 4151-52 4163 4167 4170-71 4173 4176 4180 4189-90 4258 4283 4322 4324 4326 4612 4617 4619 4624 4627 4640 4645 4659 4661 4669-70 4674 4677-78','No alterations made to record revision date as a consequence of this addition. Records already deprecated not updated.','For geographic 3D CRSs, added base geocentricCRS code and geocentric to geographic 3D conversion code to SOURCE_GEOGCRS_CODE and PROJECTION_CONV_CODE fields respectively; for geographic 2D CRSs, added base geog3DCRS code and geographic 3D to geographic 2D conversion code to SOURCE_GEOGCRS_CODE and PROJECTION_CONV_CODE fields respectively.'),
