(2005.470,'2005-09-12','2005-09-30','OGP','Correct applicability of data to Faroe Islands.','Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','6230; 4230 23030 5730 7409; 1133','Eliminated Faroe Islands from ED50, ED79 and ED87 usage.','For CRSs 5730 and 7409, changed area code from 1298 to 1299. For Area 1296 1633 and 2420 deleted Faroe Islands from area of use.'),
(2005.471,'2005-09-12','2006-04-07','OGP','Add Faroes data.','Area; Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','1296 1632 2420; 6230; 4230; 1133','Changes to areas 1296, 1632 and 2420 affect datum 6230, geogCRS 4230, projCRS 23029 and tfm 1133. These reverse elimination of ED50 (but not ED79 or ED87) from Faroe Islands usage - change 2005.47 refers.','For Area codes 1296 1632 and 2420, added Faroe Islands to Area of Use. Added datum 6741, geogCRS 4741, projCRS 3374, tfm 15866.'),
