(2005.830,'2005-12-30','2006-02-09','OGP','Correct datum origin details.','Datum','6192 6224-25 6236 6674','','For datum 6236, in origin description corrected name of fundamental point from "Doula base" to "Douala base". For datum 6236, in origin description corrected name of fundamental point from "Herat North" to "Hu Tzu Shan". For datum 6674, changed datum epoch from 1995 to 2000.'),
(2005.840,'2005-12-30','2006-02-17','OGP','Correct Brazil Chua data.','Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','6224; 4224; 1131','','For tfm 1131, corrected NGA alias from "Chua Asro" to "Chua Astro to WGS 84 (1)". For datum 6224 and CRS 4224, changed area to code 3356. For datum 6224, changed scope from topographic mapping to geodetic survey.'),
(2005.841,'2005-12-30','2005-12-30','OGP','Correct Brazil Corrego Alegre data.','Area; Coordinate Operation','1293; 1621-22','Area 1293 used by datum 6225, geogCRS 4225, projCRSs 22523-24.','Amended description and geographic bounding limits for area 1293. Added areas 3176-78 and projCRSs 22521-22 and 22525. Deprecated areas 1621-22; changed area code for projCRS 22523 from 1621 to 3177; changed area code for projCRS 22524 from 1622 to 1818. Changed area code for tfm 1132 from 1053 to 1293. For datum 6225, changed datum origin coordinates to those given by IBGE; NIMA values and supersession info added as remarks. For CRSs 4225 and 22523-24, supersession info added as remarks.'),
(2005.850,'2005-12-30','2005-12-30','OGP','Add NGA TR8350.2 names as aliases for Portugal data.','Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','6182 6616; 4182 4616 2188 2943; 1887 1965','','For each of datums 6182 and 6616, CRSs 4182 and 4616 and transformation 1965, added two US DMA/NIMA/NGA alternative identifiers as aliases, with alias remarks. For projCRSs 2188 and 2943, added US DMA/NIMA/NGA alternative identifier as alias, with alias remarks. For tfm 1887 amended existing US DMA/NIMA/NGA alternative identifier from "Observatario Meteorologico to WGS 84" to "Observatorio Meteorologico 1939 to WGS 84 (1)" and added remarks; added second US DMA/NIMA/NGA alternative identifier "Observatorio 1966 to WGS 84 (1)" with remarks.'),
(2005.860,'2005-12-20','2006-01-11','OGP','Duplicate Australian transformations to WGS 84.','','','','Added tfms 15788-89. Added cross-referencing remarks to these to tfm 1278 and 1280.'),
