(2005.880,'2005-12-30','2006-01-16','OGP','Harmonise geogCRS/datum area definitions.','Area; Datum; Coordinate Reference System','1264; 5103 5109-10 5146 6140 6278 6299 6307 6820; 5757 4299 4820','','For area 1264, added Isle of Man to name; changed CRS code 7405 area code from 1264 to 2792; changed datum code from 1264 to 2801. For CRS 5757, changed area code from 1109 to 2829. For datum 6140, changed area code from 1336 to 2784. For datum 6307, changed area code from 1026 to 1365. For datum 5109, changed area code from 1172 to 1275. For datum 5103, changed area code from 1325 to 1730. For datum 5110, changed area code from 1044 to 1347. For datum 6278, changed area code from 1354 to 1264. For CRS 4299, changed area code from 1125 to 1305. For CRS 4820, changed area code from 1295 to 1360.'),
(2005.890,'2005-12-30','2006-02-12','Christen Faber; TU Dresden','Review area definitions.','','','','Extensive changes made to area table records. These are not documented in detail here. Generically these changes include: (i) for all area records with ISO country code and maritime extent, added remarks regarding onshore and offshore extent, and added onshore only records 3212-3332.  (ii) clarifications to area of use where ISO 3166 includes dependencies etc. within a country name; (iii) corrections to erroneously-assigned areas. For (i) and (iii), relevant Datum, CRS and Coord Operation records reassigned new area code - these changes not reflected in change ID in these records.'),
(2005.891,'2005-12-30','2006-01-31','Christen Faber; TU Dresden','Add HARNS tfms for North Carolina, South Carolina, Pennsylvania','Area; Coordinate Reference System','1337; 2273','','Added projCRSs 3358-65, tfms 15834-41. For Area 1337, added North Carolina, South Carolina and Pennsylvania to area of use. For CRS 2273, changed remarks to refer to state law requiring International feet (not US survey feet).'),
(2006.010,'2006-01-02','2006-01-02','OGP','Correct Australian transformation remarks.','Coordinate Operation','1278-80, 1458-60, 1507, 1594-95 and 1803-04','','For tfms 1458 1460, in remarks updated cross reference to higher accuracy tfm from variant 10 code 1596 to variant 11 code 1803. For tfm 1594, in remarks updated cross reference to higher accuracy tfm from variant 6 code 1506 to variant 11 code 1803. For tfm1595, in remarks updated cross reference to higher accuracy tfm from variant 7 code 1507 to variant 11 code 1803. For tfm 1596, in remarks deleted "In Victoria replaces AGD66 to GDA95 (5) (code 1464)." For tfm 1803, in remarks deleted "Variant 10 (1596) replaced #5 (1464)." For tfm 1278-80, 1458-60, 1507, 1594-95 and 1803-04 Information Source URL updated to http://www.icsm.gov.au/gda.'),
