(2006.131,'2006-02-02','2006-02-03','OGP','Change geoid model source CRS.','Coordinate Operation','10013-20 10035-84','As a principle, changes source CRS for Geographic3D to GravityRelatedHeight methods from geog2D to geog3D for geoid model methods. US geoid models tfm 10013-20 are an exception noted in remarks in the tfms themselves. Documentation added to GN7-1.','For tfms 10035-83, changed source CRS code from 4283 to 4939. For tfms 10084, changed source CRS code from 4326 to 4979. For tfms 10013-20 added note to remarks.'),
