(2006.970,'2006-11-21','2006-11-28','James Rapaport; Atkins','Correct Access form CS type control list.','Coordinate System','6496-99','These amendments reflect changes included in version 2 of ISO 19111.','In Coordinate System table, field COORD_SYS_TYPE, added ''vertical'' to value list and amended description. (Historic type ''gravity-related'' retained as allowable value to accommodate existing user data). For CS 6496-99 changed CS type from ''gravity-related'' to ''vertical''. In edit/add coordinate system form, added ''vertical'' to value list, changed ''multi-linear'' to ''linear''. Help forms updated. (Edit/add Form now limited to current valid subtypes).'),
(2006.971,'2006-11-24','2007-02-02','Gerhard Sommer; Magistrat Wien','Add Austria data','Coordinate Operation; Coordinate Reference System','1618-19; 31287','For transformation 1619 the change in precision of the parameter values changes results by up to 3cm. This is not significant given the transformation accuracy of 1.5m.','Added proj 18001-09; projCRSs 31251-59 and 3416. For tfm 1619, amended tfm parameter dX from 577.3 to 577.326, dY from 90.1 to 90.129, dZ from 463.9 to 463.919 and dS from 2.42 to 2.4232 - see comment; added remarks to alias. For tfm 1618, in remarks referencing 1619 deleted "but to lesser precision ". For ProjCRS 31287 added supersession remarks. For projCRSs 31284-86 changed name. For projCRSs 31288-90 changed name and added remarks.'),
