(2007.063,'2007-07-06','2007-07-07','Guy Bergeron; CTI / ENR','Problem with report for CRS 4140','','','CRS code 4140 NAD83(CSRS98) has been deprecated. It has been replaced by NAD83(CSRS), code 4617. However the same datum record (code 6160) is used. We have no error-trapping in our reports when no infomation is returned.','Advised correspondent.'),
