(2007.078,'2007-08-24','2007-11-01','Jim Cain; ExxonMobil','Add Lambert Cylindrical Equal Area projection method and Australian projCRS','','','OGP policy is to promote ellipsoidal projection methods. In the exceptional cases where we include a spherical development we will additionally include the ellipsoidal projection formula. Australian CRS is user-specific; out of scope of EPSG dataset.','Added method 9835. GN7-2 updated. Remarks changed for method 9834.'),
