(2008.010,'2008-02-16','2008-04-11','David Burrows; ESRI','Clarify vertical offset convention documentation','Coordinate Operation Method; Coordinate Operation Parameter; Coordinate Operation','9616 9661-65; 8604 8666 8732; 5404-08 5412 5414','GN7-2 updated.','For method 9616 amended formula. Foir methods 9661-65, amended formula and remarks. For coordinate operation parameter 8604, amended description. For coordinate operation parameter 8666, amended paramete name and description. For coordinate operation parameter 8732, changed parameter name from height difference file to vertical offset file. Deprecated tfms 5404-08, 5412 and 5414 and added replacements 5447-50, 5452 and 5454-55. Added tfms 5438, 5440-43, 5445-46. Deprecated CRSs 7412-13 and added replacements 7421-22. For CRSs 5600-10, 5701-03, 5705-06, 5709-13, 5716-99, 7400, 7404-07, 7409, 7411 and 7414-20, added "height" or "depth" to name and if relevant also to alias and abbreviation; for CRSs 5719, 5721, 5724-25, 5728-29, 5731-33, 5736-37, 5751-52, 5754, 5756-57, 5784, 5791 and 5794 also amended remarks. For Tfms 5400, 5402-03, 5409-11, 5413, 5415-17, 5419-22, 5424-33 and 5435-37 added "height" or "depth" to name and if relevant alias and abbreviation; amended remarks. For Tfms 10000-84, 15781 and 15596-15697 added "height" to name and if relevant alias and abbreviation. Added vertCRSs 5611-12.'),
(2008.011,'2008-03-06','2008-09-24','Cristian Balint: Gea Cart SRL','Add S42 CRS for Romania and other East European countries','Area; Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','1805; 6317; 2492-93 4317 28402-03 31700; 1097 1287-89 1292-93 1996.','These changes limit Pulkovo 1942 to former USSR and Pulkovo 1942(58) and Pulkovo 1942(83) to former Warsaw Pact countries. The status of Dealul Piscului in Romania is clarified.','Deprecated areas 1357 and 1805, datum 6317, CRSs 2492-93, 4317, 28402-03 and 31700 and tfms 1097, 1287-89, 1292-93 and 1996. Added areas 3574-88, CRSs 3833-44 and tfms 15496-97 and 15995-99. For areas 1513-14, amended name, area of use and bounding box. For area 1793, added FSU to name and deleted Slovakia from area of use (used by CRSs 2494 and 28404). For datums 6178-79, amended name, changed alias naming system, added remarks and changed area code to 3574 (E Europe). For CRS 4178, changed area code from 1343 (E Germany) to 3574 (E Europe); added aliases and remarks. For CRS 4179, changed area code from 1192 (Poland) to 3574 (E Europe); added aliases and remarks. For CRS 4200, added alias. For datum 6284, amended name and changed area code to 2423 (FSU). For datum 6284 and CRS 4284, changed area code from 1357 (E Europe + FSU) to 2423 (FSU), added alias and remarks to CRS. For CRSs 2397-98, reversed name and alias, amended scope and remarks. For CRS 2399, reversed name and alias, changed area code, amended scope and remarks. For CRSs 3329-32, changed area code, amended scope and added remarks. For CRSs 3396-99 and 31466-69, reversed name and alias. For datum 6317, CRSs 4317 and 31600, and tfm 1995, in names changed 33 to 30 and made previous names aliases.'),
