(2008.054,'2008-06-23','2008-07-05','OGP','Correct spellings in area names and descriptions','Area','1050 1161 1284 1321 1421-28 1459-60 1574 1576 1579-81 1598 1601 1639 1668-69 1696 1709-10 1714 1741 1795 2064 2066 2169-70 2191 2300 2387-88 2648 2706 2790 2830 2837-38 2993-94 3062 3074 3374 3452 3454 3465 3484 3535 3539 3541-42','2nd and 3rd actions of change request 2008.053 are misreported in that change record. They were made through this change record.','For areas 1050, 1321, 1709-10, 2064, 2066 and 2830, in area name and area description changed spelling of Herzegovina. For area 1284, in area description corrected spelling of Belarus and Moldova; in area name changed "Former Soviet Union" to "FSU" for consistency with other FSU-related areas. For area 3535, in area name deleted "onshore and offshore". For areas 1161, 1639, 1696, 1795, 2387-88, 2648, 2706, 2994, 3062, 3074, 3374, 3452, 3454, 3465, 3484 and 3539, in area name corrected "typos" introduced in making change 2008.045. For areas 1598, 1601, 1668-69, 1714, 1741, 2169-70, 2191, 2300, 2837-38, 2993 and 3541-42 in area description corrected "typos" introduced in making change 2008.045. For areas 1421-28, 1459-60, 1574, 1576, 1579-81 and 2790 in area description corrected minor "typos".'),
