(2009.014,'2009-02-20','2009-06-02','Jens Luthard; BKG','Update Germany CRS and transformation areas of validity','Area; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','2127 2860-62; 3043-45 25833; 1775 1778','See also change request 2009.008.','Added naming system 1025. For CRS 3043, added Eurogeographics and Germany alternative identifiers. For CRS 3044, added Eurogeographics and Germany alternative identifiers, in scope added reference to Mecklenburg. For CRS 3045, added Eurogeographics and Germany alternative identifiers, in scope added reference to Mecklenburg, in remarks added reference to Brandenburg. For CRS 25833, in remarks removed reference to Brandenburg and added those for ETRF. For area 2127, in description removed reference to Germany [impacts CRS 25833]. For areas 2860-62, changed name and area description.  For tfm 1775, changed area code from 3396 to 1343, added remarks regarding 2009 replacement of tfm 1674 for all former East Germany. For tfm 1778, amended remarks.'),
(2009.015,'2009-02-20','2009-06-02','Mikael Rittri; Carmenta AB','Correct use of MGI in former Yugoslavia','Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','6312 6805; 4312 4805 2170 3787 31275-77 31279; 1306 1452-53 1465 1535 1620-21 1636-37 1757 1785 1794-95 2181-87 2293 2974 3792 3803-10 8263 8645 15981-92','Different Greenwich values for the Ferro meridian adopted in Austria and former Yugoslavia mean that on transformation of the MGI (Ferro) CRS to Greenwich the MGI (Greenwich) datum and depending CRSs are not applicable to former Yugoslavia.','Added datums 1031 and 1034, geodetic CRSs 3906 and 4073-75, tfms 4076-77. Deprecated projCRSs 2170, 3787, 31275-77 and 31279 and added replacements 3907-12. Deprecated tfms 1306, 1452-53, 1465, 1535, 1620-21, 1636-37, 1757, 1785, 1794-95, 2181-87, 2293, 2974, 3792, 3803-10, 8263, 8645 and 15981-92 and added replacements 3895-96, 3914-19, 3921-41 and 3951-66. Deprecated tfm 1795 without replacement. For datum 6312 and CRS 4312, changed area of use from Austria and former Yugoslavia to Austria, deleted Croatian and Slovene aliases. For datum 6805, added alias and remarks. For CRS 4805, deleted aliases and added remarks.'),
(2009.016,'2009-02-28','2009-06-02','Susana Arciniegas; IGM','Add Ecuador SIRGAS data','','','','Added area 3638. For CRS 31992, changed area code from 1824 to 3638, added information source and amended remarks. Added tfms 3971 and 3990.'),
