(2009.023,'2009-03-31','2009-06-07','Mikael Rittri; Carmenta AB','Correct Equidistant Cylindrical formula and parameters','Coordinate Operation Method; Coordinate Operation; Coordinate Reference System','1024 1026 1027 9823 9834 9842; 19846 19968; 3786 32663','GN7-2 updated.','Deprecated methods 9823 and 9842, projections 19846 and 19968 and projCRSs 3786 and 32663; added replacement methods 1028-29, proj 4085-86 and CRS 4087-88, For method 9834, added formula. For methods 1026 and 1027, in formula added comments regarding R. For method 1024, in formula made typographic corrections.'),
