(2009.028,'2009-04-25','2011-03-28','OGP','Add new SIRGAS / ITRF national realisation(s) for Argentina.   See remarks below.','Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','6190 6694; 4190 4694 4928 4929 4960-61 22171-77 22181-87; 1774','This change request limited in Feb 2011 to new SIRGAS / ITRF realization in Argentina to make QC more reasonable.  Other new ITRF / SIRGAS national realizations have been moved to Change Record 2011.018.','Added datum 1062, geodetic CRSs 5340-5342, projCRSs 5443-5349 and transformations 5350-51. For datums 6190 6694, changed remarks. In geogCRS 4190 4694 4928 4929 4960-61 and in projCRS 22171-177 and 22181-187, added remarks to reflect new adoption of POSGAR 2007. For transformation 1774, amended name from "POSGAR 98 to SIRGAS (1)" to "POSGAR 98 to SIRGAS 95 (1)" to properly reflect target CRS name; added previous name as alias.'),
(2009.029,'2009-04-25','2009-06-02','David Burrows; ESRI','Prescribe non-overlapping code ranges for entity types.','','','Not accepted. Policy remains that codes are unique within entity type but otherwise are meaningless. Users assign meaning at their own risk. There has been overlap in codes allocated across different entity types for many years.','Advised correspondent.'),
(2009.030,'2009-04-26','2010-02-18','OGP','Add Netherlands concatanated tfm','Coordinate Operation','1046-47 1050-51','Carried from change request 2009.013 pending registry software upgrade.','Added tfm 4837. For tfms 1046-47 and 1050-51 added cross reference to code 4837.'),
(2009.031,'2009-04-27','2010-03-05','OGP','Add BLM projCRSs for US onshore','Area; Coordinate Operation; Coordinate Reference System','2172-73 2205 2256 3357 3498-3500 3502-06; 15914-17; 32064-67 32164-67','Postal service and MMS codes have been omitted from the revised descriptions (see change 2009.032). In Area 3357, protraction area extension references omitted. For areas 2205, 2256 and 2173, corrected Sabine Pass and Lloyd Ridge protraction area names.','Added areas 3637 and 3640-42, proj 4101-19 and 4186-87; projCRSs 4217, 4290, 4399-4413, 4418-33, 4438-53 and 4458-59. For Areas 2172-73, 2205 and 2256, amended area description (eliminating MMS codes).  For Area 3357, amended area description and area name. For Areas 3502-06 corrected bounding box latitude values. For proj 15914-17 and projCRSs 32064-67 and 32164-67, changed area of use code (from GoM to Conus + GoM). Deprecated duplicate areas 3482-87, 3490 and 3493; amended CRSs 3706-13 to use replacement rather than deprecated areas. For areas 3498-3500, removed state postal abbreviations.'),
(2009.032,'2009-05-08','2009-06-30','OGP','Harmonise state and province abbreviations in area descriptions','','','Agreed that an area text string search using 2-character text code is insufficiently constrained to be useful. Such codes will be omitted from area descriptions. Existing abbreviations will be removed when area records are relevant to a change request.','See remarks.'),
