(2009.059,'2009-07-21','2009-07-22','Andrew de Klerk; Quartex','Add South Africa Grid System definitions to Proj.4.','','','The reason why there is no definition for the South African grid system (or SW African system) is that, unlike the EPSG dataset, Proj.4 currently does not support the South-orientated Transverse Mercator projection method.','Advised correspondent to contact Proj.4 administration.'),
(2009.060,'2009-07-21','2009-07-22','OGP','Add missing deprecation trails.','Area','1357 1805','See change request 2008.011.','For areas 1357 and 1805, added deprecation trails.'),
