(2009.062,'2009-07-24','2009-10-29','Andrew de Klerk; Quartex','Add South Africa grids as a standard TM projection','','','Request rejected. Although the work-around suggested does work in South Africa, it does not work for a general SOTM case where there are non-zero values of FE. OGP recomends implementation of full SOTM method.','Advised correspondent.'),
(2009.063,'2009-07-24','2009-07-29','OGP','Correct area records','Area','1194 1253-54 1335 1349 1992 2030 2032 2038 2116 2251 3329','','For area 1992, in area of use description changed 180° to 180°E. For area 2116, in name changed "168°E to 168°E" to "168°E to 174°E". For areas 1194, 1253 and 1254, amended bounding box coordinates. For areas 1335 and 2251 amended name, area of use description, bounding box coordinates and added remarks. For areas 2030 and 2032, in area of use description deleted Puerto Rico. For area 2038, in area of use description added Puerto Rico and amended references to Virgin Islands. For area 1349, in area of use description added Puerto Rico and amended references to Virgin Islands. For area 3329, in area of use description added island names.'),
(2009.064,'2009-07-26','2009-09-05','OGP','Update Virgin Island data','Area; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','1350 1511 3420; 2866 3920 3991-92 26920; 1495 1731 8481 8583','See change requests 2009.044 and  2009.063 for amendments to areas 1337 and 1335 respectively.','For area 1350, added Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands: amended area of use description and bounding box values [impacts NAD83]. For area 1511, added Puerto Rico and US Virgin Islands: amended name, area of use description and bounding box values [impacts NAD83(NSRS2007)]. For area 3420, added British Virgin Islands: amended area of use description and bounding box values [impacts NAD83 / UTM zone 20]. Added CRS 4437. For CRS 2866, in remarks added replacement cross-reference. For CRSs 3920 and 3991-92 [projCRSs based on Puerto Rico datum], amended area code from 1253, 1194 and 1254 respectively (onshore and offshore) to 3329, 3294 and 3330 respectively (onshore). For CRSs 3920 and 26920, added remarks regarding replacement. Added area 3634. Deprecated tfm 8481 and added replacement 4435. For tfm 8583, changed area code from 1335 to 3634 [removes BVI from NADCON tfms, limits applicability to onshore] and in remarks amended cross-referencing code. For tfms 1495 and 1731, changed area code from 1335 to 2251 [removes BVI from NADCON tfms].'),
