(2009.073,'2009-10-02','2009-11-24','OGP','Correct France Guadeloupe and Martinique data','Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','6640; 4972-73 4640 2989; 1934 10004-05 15488-92','Ellipsoid should be GRS 1980 rather than WGS 84.','Deprecated datum 6640, CRSs 4972-73, 4640 and 2989 and transformations 1934, 10004-05 and 15488-92; added replacement datum 1047, CRSs 4556-59 and transformations 4560-67. For datums 6621-22 and 6625 and CRSs 4621-22, 4625, 2969-70 and 2973, in remarks amended cross-referenced code.'),
