(2009.079,'2009-10-06','2013-07-21','OGP','For deprecated Mauritania data, provide clearer reason for deprecation','Change; Datum; Coordinate reference system; Coordinate operation','2005.580; 6681; 4681 3103-05; 10095-97','Associations between this change request and the entities listed in codes affected have not been created.','For deprecation trail codes 1038-50, amended reason for deprecation. For change request 2005.580, in codes affected added missing CRS codes.'),
(2009.080,'2009-10-06','2014-11-21','Stefan Horvatin; softelec','Check peninsula Malaysia RSO ellipsoid definition','Coordinate Reference System','3167-68','The GDM 2000 Technical Manual example uses the Everest 1830 Modified ellipsoid for the old Malaya RSO. But colonial British documentation clearly shows that for the RSO projection the yard/metre conversion factor adopted was 0.914398 exactly.','Notified correspondent.'),
