(2011.051,'2011-05-23','2011-06-30','OGP','Clarify North American areas and associated geodetic entities.','Area; Datum; Coordinate Operation; Coordinate Reference System.','1289 1420-21 1439 2227 2275 2413-2414 2828-29 2890-95; 6212; 1185 1187 1495 1731 4101-4106 4187 4325 15230 15400 15793 15841 15970 17700 17702 19943; 2008-09 2866 2944-48 2950-52 4212 4401-4406 4414 4420-4426 4437 21291-92 32084-86 32180 32183-90.','','Deprecated areas 1420-21 and associated map projection 17700 and projected CRSs 2008 2944 and 32180; created new areas 3865 3875 3880 for Labrador, revised name and description for area 1439 since Ontario does not extend to 96W; revised names of Canadian areas 2227 and 2275 to reflect correct use in Newfoundland and Labrador; added "onshore" to appropriate Guadeloupe island areas 2828-29 2890-95 and Bahamas areas 2413 2414; reassigned all geodetic entities relating to Barbados 1938 (Datum 6212, GeogCRS 4212, coordinate transformation 15793, map projection conversion 19943, ProjCRS 21291-21292) from area 1042 to area 3218; reassigned coordinate transformation 15970 for Bermuda from area 1047 to area 3221; reassigned Puerto Rico and US Virgin Islands SPCS83 projection 15230, ProjCRS 2866 4437 and coordinate transformations 1495 and 1731 from area 2251 to area 3634; reassigned Cuba DMA transformation 1185 from area 1077 to area 3235; reassigned Guam onshore map projections 4325 15400 and ProjCRS 4414 from area 1110 to area 3255; reassigned Mexico DMA transformation 1187 from area 1160 to area 3278; reassigned Puerto Rico HARN transformation 15841 from area 1194 to area 3294; changed name of projection 17702 to MTM zone 2; changed area for CRS 32183 from 2275 to 2290 to include Quebec east of 60°W as well as Newfoundland and Labrador; changed area for CRS 2945 from 1421 to 2290 to include Newfoundland and Labrador; changed area for CRS 2009 from 1421 to 1446 (Quebec - east of 60°W); changed area for CRSs 32084-86 to the 3 new Labrador areas; changed areas for CRSs 2946-48 (NAD83(CSRS) / MTM 4-6) to 2276-78 respectively to include Labrador and Quebec as for CRSs 32184-86 (NAD83(86)); changed areas for CRSs 2950-52 (NAD83(CSRS) / MTM 8-10) to 2279-81 respectively to include Ontario and Quebec as for CRSs 32184-86 (NAD83(86)); added SCoPQ aliases for CRSs 32183-90; reassigned Alaska BLM map projections (4101-4106 and 4187) and associated projected CRSs (4400-4406 and 4420-4426) to their appropriate "AK, OCS" areas from those previously deprecated as duplicates. For area 1289, amended area.'),
