(2014.027,'2014-04-09','2017-10-16','Victor Minor; Blue Marble','Clarify transformations for vertical CRSs','Coordinate operation method; Coordinate operation; Coordinate Reference System','1046 1050 9616 9843-44; 5400 5402-03 5409-11 5413 5419 5425 5427 5432 5438 5441-43 5445-50 5452-55; 5702 5754 6130-32 6358-60','Issued new guidance note 373-24, revised GN7-1 and GN7-2.','Deprecated transformations 5400, 5402, 5409-11, 5413, 5441-42, 5446, 5448-49 and 5453-55. Added area 4464, parameter 1051, methods 1068-69, conversions 7812-13, 7963, 7972, 7978, 7982, 7984-85, 7988-89, 8038-39, 8054-57, 8060, 8229 and 8354-56; CRSs 7962, 7968, 7976, 7979, 8050-53 and 8228, transformations 7964, 7966, 7969-71, 7977, 7980-81 and 8037 and concatenated operations 7965, 7967, 7973-75, 7983 and 7986-87. For methods 9616 and 1046, revised formula description (in line with changes made in GN7-2). For method 1050, amended formula description. For methods 9843-44 capitalised name. For CRSs 5702, 5754, 6130-32 and 6359 and transformations 6138-40, in name added units and created alias of previous name; for CRSs 6358 and 6360, amended cross-referencing remarks to include these revised names. For transformations 5403, 5419, 5425, 5427, 5432, 5438, 5443, 5445, 5447, 5450 and 5452, reworded scope and remarks.'),
