(2015.049,'2015-09-27','2015-11-25','Melita Kennedy; ESRI','Correct US geoid model areas','Area; Coordinate operation','2975-76 2979-80; 6326-27 10013-20','For transformations 6326-27 the geoid model files for Conus and Alaska were reissued in November 2014 with new name but no changes to undulation values.','Added transformations 7646-50. For transformations 6326-27, changed parameter file name from g2012a* to g2012B* and amended remarks. For transformations 10013-20, corrected area of use code (N and S tiers transposed). For area 2978, in name capitalised CONUS and amended area description. For areas 2975-76 and 2980, in name and description, changed -88°W to -78°W and amended bounding box and polygon; amended States in description.  For area 2979, in name and description, changed -88°W to -78°W and amended bounding box and polygon; added States to description; in name capitalised CONUS.'),
