(2015.060,'2015-11-17','2015-11-25','Urs Marti; swisstopo','Add and amend Switzerland data','Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','2056 4149-50 4932-33 21780-82; 1509 1646-47 1753 1766 15486 19950','For tfm 15846 the old file CHENyx06 and its replacement CHENyx06a are almost the same. In the CHENyx06a there is a small area at the border of the dataset where some more "real" data has been introduced. swisstopo consider the change to be insignificant.','Added transformations 7673-74. For CRS 2056, changed coordinate system code from 4498 to 4400; added information source. For CRSs 4149 and 4150, added information source and remarks. For CRSs 4932 and 4933, added information source. For transformations 1509, 1646-47, 1753 and 1766 and projection 19950, in info source updated spelling of Landestopographie to Landestopografie; for transformations 1509 and 1753 also added alias. For transformation 15486, in info source updated spelling of Landestopographie to Landestopografie; also amended NTv2 file name from CHENyx06.gsb to CHENyx06a.gsb (see change request remarks) and amended  remarks. For CRSs 21780-82, amended info source.'),
