(2015.062,'2015-11-20','2015-11-25','IOGP','Harmonise Energistics UoM names and symbols','Naming System; Unit of Measure','7306; 1025-26 1031 1033 1035 1040 9001-03 9005 9014 9030-31 9033-43 9050-53 9060-63 9070 9080-87 9093-99 9101-08 9110-22 9201-02 9300-02','','For naming system 7306, changed POSC [acronym] to Energistics [symbol]. Added naming systems 1040-41. Deprecated UoM 9106 and added 9106 name and symbol as aliases to 9105. For UoM degree representations 9107-08, 9115-20 and 9122 and pseudo-units 9110-11 and 9121, removed POSC acronym alias. For UoM 9014, 9093, 9102-04 and 9112-14, added Energistics name as alias. For UoM 9003, 9031, 9033-35, 9040-43, 9050-53, 9060-63, 9070, 9080-87 and 9094-95, changed POSC acronym alias to Energistics symbol. For UoM 9097-99 and 9300-02, added Energistics symbol as alias. For UoM 1026, 1031 and 1035 added Energistics name and symbol as aliases. For UoM 9005, 9030, 9037-39 and 9201 added Energistics name as alias and amended Energistics symbol aliases. For UoM 1025, 1033, 1040,  9001-02, 9036, 9096, 9101 and 9202, removed duplication of EPSG and Energistics aliases.'),
