(2016.007,'2016-02-09','2016-02-15','Kevin Sorensen; 4dnav.com','Data missing from Access export','','','v8.8 Access data generated through superseded version of macro causing some time-dependent units to be missing. Impacted UoM 1029-30 and 1032, methods 1053 or 1056 and transformations 6276-6302, 6313-15 and 6864-66. Dataset v8.7 and earlier unaffected.','Access and SQL versions of Dataset v8.8 withdrawn and replaced by v8.9. Note: content of online registry not affected by this problem.'),
