(2016.010,'2016-02-19','2016-04-06','Andreas Schmid; AfG Solothurn','Amend Swiss transformations','Coordinate Operation','1646 1766 7674','This reverses the change from 3dp to 1dp made through change request 2001.121 prior to the v5.2 dataset release in June 2001. The difference in output of cms which this causes is considered by swisstopo to be insignificant within the accuracy of the tfm.','Added transformation 7788. For transformations 7674, amended remarks. For transformations 1646 and 1766 changed parameter values from 1dp precision to 3dp (from tX=674.4, tY=15.1, tZ=405.4 to tX=674.374, tY=15.056, tZ=405.346), amended info source and remarks, added supersession trail. For tfm 1646 also added remarks to EuroGeographics alias.'),
