(2016.012,'2016-02-25','2016-04-06','Walter Peterscheck; Magvar','Add US North Dakota ftUS data','','','Because the international foot is the unit recognised in ND state legislation we are unable to add the inappropriate ftUS definitions to the EPSG Dataset. The EPSG Dataset indicates what should be used, not what could be used but should not be.','Request rejected.'),
