(2017.037,'2017-08-31','2018-02-16','Martin Kalivoda; UGKK','Add Slovakia data','Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation; Coordinate Operation Method','1052 1055 5105 6156 6818; 2065 4156 4818 5221 5224-25 5228-29 5513-16 5612 5705; 4827 4829 5201-04 5209-10 5218 5435-38 5440 5443 5445 5447 5509-10 8060 19952; 1041-43 9819 9635 9665','','Added naming systems 1042 and 1043; datums 1201-1202; CRSs 8351-8353, 8357-8358 and 8360; conversion 8359; transformations 8361-8365, 8367-8368 and 8442-43. For datums 6156 and 6818, amended name (to English to be language-neutral), added Slovak alias and information source, changed naming system for Czech alias, removed remarks. For datums 1052 and 1055, amended name (to English to be consistent with 6156/6818 and 1201), changed alias naming system from EPSG to Czech, removed remarks. For projections 5218, 5509-10 and 19952 added Slovak information source and amended cone axis from 30°17''17.303" to 30°17''17.30311"; amended examples in methods 9819 and 1041-43 to use this new value. For CRSs 4156 and 4818, added Slovak information source and amended remarks. For CRSs 2065 and 5221, added Slovak information source and amended scope and remarks. For CRSs 5224 and 5225, amended alias and remarks. For CRSs 5228, 5229, 5515 and 5516, amended remarks. For CRSs 5513 and 5514, amended remarks and added alias. For datum 5105, CRSs 5612 and 5705 and conversion 8060, added ''1977'' to name, changed area from 1306 to 2423 (removing former Czechoslovakia). For transformations 5438, 5440, 5443, 5445 and 5447, added ''1977'' to name. For transformations 5203, 5204, 5209, 5210, 5436 and 5437, added ''1977'' to name and amended scope. For transformations 5201, 5202 and 5435, added ''1957'' to name and amended scope. For methods 9635 and 9665, amended name. For transformations 4827 and 4829, changed status to superseded.'),
