(2017.052,'2017-11-07','2019-05-17','David Burrows; ESRI','Registry WKT export precision','','','Stored length values derived from metres shall be stored to a precision of approximately 1mm (3 decimal places for a foot). To avoid problems with application usage, no retrospective change of existing US State Plane projection FE/FN values will be made.','Notified correspondent that from EPSG Dataset v10 (3Q 2019) policy will be to show unit conversion ratio derived from factors b and c to 15 significant figures. Ellipsoid 1/f derived from a and b will continue to be shown to 7 decimal places. The values of parameters stored in the registry will be shown at the resolution stored.'),
