(2018.009,'2018-02-06','2018-04-20','Dan Jaksa; Geoscience Australia','Add Australia GDA2020 data','Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation Method; Coordinate Operation','5111 5112; 5711 5712; 1048; 1150 8048','','Added area 4493 and transformations 8444-48 and 8450-51. For transformation 8048 amended scope and remarks. For method 1048, changed name from Ausgeoid09 to Ausgeoid v2 and added previous name as alias. For datum 5112 and CRS 5712, changed status to superseded. For datum 5111, added remarks and origin description, changed area code from 1281 to 4493, changed publication date and information source. For CRS 5711, added remarks and additional aliases, changed area code from 1281 to 4493, changed information source. For transformation 1150, amended accuracy (from 1m to 3m) and scope, added remarks and changed area code from 2575 to 4177.'),
