(2018.025,'2018-05-10','2018-05-12','IOGP','Correct truncated text strings','Coordinate Operation','8256-58 8261','Previous text strings were truncated at 254 characters when exported to Access and the three SQL scripts.','For transformations 8256-58, information source changed from '' "Modern Geodetic Reference Frames for Precise Satellite Positioning and Navigation", J. Kouba and J. Popelar, International Symposium on Kinematic Systems in Geodesy, Geomatics and Navigation, Banff, Canada, August 30 -September 2, 1994. Also "The Evolution of NAD83 in Canada", M. Craymer, Geodetic Survey Division, Natural Resources Canada in Geomatica, Volume 60, No. 2, 2006.'' to '' "The Evolution of NAD83 in Canada", M. Craymer, Geodetic Survey Division, Natural Resources Canada, in Geomatica Volume 60, No. 2, 2006.''. For transformation 8261, information source changed from ''(i) Geodetic Survey Division, Natural Resources Canada. (ii) Soler and Snay "Transforming Positions and Velocities between the International Terrestrial Reference Frame of 2000 and the North American Datum of 1983", Journal of Survey Engineering, May 2004 and at US National Geodetic Survey http://geodesy.noaa.gov/CORS'' to ''Soler and Snay "Transforming Positions and Velocities between the International Terrestrial Reference Frame of 2000 and the North American Datum of 1983", Journal of Survey Engineering, May 2004.''.'),
