(2018.056,'2018-09-24','2018-09-27','IOGP','Correct US NAD83(FBN) CRS','Coordinate Reference System','4152 4269 8449 8541 8542 8557-58 8663-64 8666-67 8671-72','','Deprecated CRS 8449 and added replacement 8860 with updated remarks. Deprecated transformations dependent on CRS 8449 (8557-58, 8663-64, 8666-67 and 8671-72) and added replacements 8861-68. For CRSs 4152, 4269, 8541 and 8542, updated remarks.'),
(2018.057,'2018-09-25','2018-09-27','IOGP','Address sql script problem','Coordinate Operation','7957','The second parameter was inconsistent with the method definition and causing model errors in running some sql scripts.','For deprecated coordinate operation 7957, removed spurious second parameter and added note to remarks.'),
