(2018.060,'2018-10-03','2019-01-14','IOGP','Swaziland name change to Eswatini','Area; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','1224 1290 1462 2071 2312 2830; 4148 4940-41; 1505','','For areas 1224, 1290 and 2312, in name changed Swaziland to Eswatini, in description added Eswatini.  For areas 1462, 2071 and 2830, in description added Eswatini. Added area 4540. For datum 6168, CRSs 4940-41 and 4148 and transformation 1505, changed area code from 1215 to 4540.'),
