(2018.065,'2018-11-20','2019-01-14','Greg Pilgim; Exxon','Add Singapore transformation','Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','3414 4757; 15922','Extended CRS 3414 scope from cadastre to also include engineering survey and topographic mapping. For CT 15922, removed reference to an unspecified similarity transformation.','Added transformation 8886. For CRSs 3414 and 4757, amended scope. For transformation 15922, amended remarks.'),
