(2019.004,'2019-02-02','2019-02-21','IOGP','Clarify scale parameter in Similarity transformation method','Coordinate Operation Parameter; Coordinate Operation','8612-16; 1035','Scale parameter name changed through separate CR 2019.005. Scale also clarified in 7-, 10- and 15-parameter transformations in the geocentric CRS domain (CR 2019.006). Also made minor changes in Guidance Note 7-2.','Added parameter 1061. For parameters 8612 and 8613, in name abbreviated ''CRS'', added previous full name as alias, added abbreviation.  For parameters 8614-16, in name abbreviated ''CRS'', added previous full name as alias. For transformation 1035, changed value of scale from scale difference = 0ppm to scale factor = unity, added remarks.'),
(2019.006,'2019-02-10','2019-02-21','IOGP','Clarify scale parameter in geocentric transformation methods','Coordinate Operation Method; Coordinate Operation Parameter','1032-34 1037-39 1053-58 1061-63 1065-66 9606-07 9636; 8611','','For methods 1032-34, 1053, 1056 and 1061, in formula amended description of M to clarify that M = (1 + dS) and in example added value of M.  For methods 1037-39, 1054-55, 1057-58, 1062-63, 1066, 9606-07 and 9636, in example added value of M. For method 1065, added example. For parameter 8611, amended description.'),
(2019.007,'2019-02-12','2019-02-21','IOGP','Correct origin description for Iran datum','Datum','9314','Added missing hemisphere indicator.','For datum 9314, in origin description (anchor definition) corrected projected CRS name.'),
