(2019.018,'2019-03-29','2019-05-03','IOGP','Correct Equal Earth formula, clarify Mercator formulas','Coordinate Operation Method','1044 1078 9805','GN7-2 updated.','For method 1078, in reverse formula corrected transposition of N and E, corrected example. For methods 1044 and 9805, clarified reverse formula by adding additional parentheses.'),
