(2019.020,'2019-04-01','2019-07-17','IOGP','Add SIRGAS-CON','Coordinate Reference System; Area','4170 4674 4974-75 4988-89; 3418 3421-22 3427-28 3748 3756 3759 3763','Updates to area records impact SIRGAS 2000 rather than SIRGAS-CON.','Added area 4530, datums 1227-42, CRSs 8915-46 and 8972-87 and CTs 8952-67 and 9051-52. For CRSs 4170, 4674, 4974-75 and 4988-89, added ISO aliases. For areas 3418, 3421-22, 3427-28, 3748, 3756, 3759 and 3763, added ''Latin America'' to description.'),
