(2019.024,'2019-04-15','2019-05-17','IOGP','Correct Germany area descriptions','Area; Coordinate Reference System','2860-62; 3043-45','Revised description for areas 2860-62 removes use across EU, limits it to Germany.','For areas 2860-2862, amended area description. For CRSs 3043-45 changed area code from 2860-62 to 2125-27.'),
(2019.025,'2019-04-17','2019-05-03','IOGP','Correct Christmas Island and Cocos Island transformations','Coordinate Operations','8444-45','Considered a minor update because preliminary file names XMAS_C_V1.gsb and COCOS_C_V1.gsb provided by information source were never published under those names. Only files having the corrected names have been made public.','For transformation 8444, changed parameter file name. For transformation 8445, changed parameter file name and amended transformation version to correct ISO 3166 code.'),
(2019.026,'2019-04-18','2019-05-03','Even Rouault; Spatialys','Correct CRS type for Costa Rica transformations','Coordinate Operation','8913-14','','Deprecated transformations 8913 and 8914, added replacements 8968 and 8969.'),
(2019.027,'2019-04-25','2019-07-17','Peter Strobl; EU JRC','Review EU LAEA extent','Coordinate Reference System','3034-35 5632-39','ETRS89 / LAEA and ETRS89 / LCC projected CRSs are formally limited to the area of ETRS89 (stable parts of the Eurasian plate), but practical usage is extended for pan-European analysis at small scales.','Added CRSs 9039 and 9040 and transformations 9041-9050. For CRSs 3034 and 3035, changed area code from 1298 to 2881, in name appended ''-extended'' to ''ETRS89'', added previous name as alias, supplemented remarks. For CRSs 5632-5637, in remarks appended ''-extended'' to ''ETRS89'', added reference to transformation. For CRSs 5638 and 5639, in remarks appended ''-extended'' to ''ETRS89'', added reference to transformation and added replacement comments.'),
(2019.028,'2019-05-03','2019-05-03','IOGP','Version 9.6.2 interim registry release','','','Registry, including SQL scripts. Not Access.','Released change requests 2019.017, 2019.018, 2019.023, 2019.025 and 2019.026.'),
(2019.030,'2019-05-09','2019-05-17','IOGP','Update country names','Area; Coordinate Operation Method; Naming System','1079 1148 1284 1298-99 1306 1321 1513-14 1711-12 2066 2370 1792 2064 2830 2881 3574 3576-78 3580-82 3594 3900 4455-56; 1041 9819; 1042 1045','','For areas 1079 and 1148, amended name and description and added former name as alias. For areas 1321 1711-12, 2066 and 2370, in description amended name of North Macedonia. For areas 1284, 1299, 1306, 1513-14, 1792, 2064, 3574, 3576-78, 3580-82, 3594, 3900, and 4450-56, in description amended name of Czechia. For areas 2830, 2881, in description amended names of Czechia and North Macedonia. For area 1298, in description amended names of Czechia and North Macedonia; removed Ukraine to make description consistent with polygon. For methods 1041 and 9819, in formula updated country name. For naming systems 1042 and 1045, in description updated country name.'),
(2019.031,'2019-05-09','2019-05-17','IOGP','Add ITRF and IGS data','Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation; Datum','4896 4910-19 5332 6934 7789 7900-12 8227; 6281 6283-89 6291-6300 6302 6389 7790 7814 8069-8079; 1141 1191','','Added naming systems 1046-47, datums 1244-1248, CRSs 8988-9019 and CTs 9020-9038. For CRSs 4910-4917 and 7900-7907 and CTs 6281, 6283-6289, 6291-6300, 6302, 6389, 7790, 7814 and 8069-8079, added ISO aliases. For CRS 8227, added ISO aliases, in remarks added reference to ITRF, changed area code from 1262 to 2830. For CRS 6934, added ISO aliases and in remarks added reference to ITRF. For CRSs 4896, 4918-4919, 5332, 7789 and 7908-7912, removed IGS alias and added ISO aliases. For datums 1141 and 1191, removed aliases and updated anchor definition and remarks.'),
(2019.032,'2019-05-10','2019-07-17','IOGP','Add geog2D CRS and ISO reference to WGS 84 data','Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','3855 5773 5798 7656-65 7815-16; 3858-59 7666-72 10084 15871','','Added CRSs 8888 and 9053-57 and transformation 9145. Deprecated transformation 7671 and added replacement 9076. For CRSs 3855, 5773, 5798, 7656-65 and 7815-16 and transformations 7666-70 and 7672, added ISO reference. For transformations 3858-59, added ISO reference and information source, amended remarks to include reference to spherical harmonic alternative. For transformation 10084, added ISO reference, amended remarks to include reference to spherical harmonic alternative. For transformation 10084, added ISO reference, amended remarks to include reference to spherical harmonic alternative and alternative file name.'),
(2019.036,'2019-05-10','2019-07-17','IOGP','Add ISO reference to Japan data','Coordinate Reference System','4612 4946-47 6666-68 6694-95','','For CRSs 4612, 4946-47, 6666-68 and 6694-95, added ISO reference.'),
(2019.037,'2019-05-10','2019-07-16','IOGP','Add New Zealand data','Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','4167 4272 4440 4958-59 7839; 1566 1568 1701 4459 7840','Deformation model supersession records to be added in change request 2019.049.','Added method 1079, transformations 9079-90 and concatenated operations 9091-9102. For CRSs 4167, 4272, 4440, 4958-59 and 7839 and transformations 1566, 1568, 1701, 4459 and 7840, added ISO reference.'),
(2019.038,'2019-05-10','2019-07-17','IOGP','Add geog2D CRS and ISO reference to ETRF data','Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','5621 5730 7914-31 8397 8399; 5900 7932-39 7941-51','','Added CRSs 9059-69. For CRSs 5621, 5730, 7914-31, 8397 and 8399 and transformations 5900, 7932-39 and 7941-51, added ISO register references.'),
