(2019.042,'2019-05-27','2019-07-17','Bashkim Idrizi; University of Pristina','Add Kosovo data','Area; Datum; Coordinate Reference System; Coordinate Operation','1298 1321 1711 2066 2370 2830 2881 3534; 1034 1214 1216; 4073-75 8682-85 8691; 4076-77 7675-76 8893-94','Addition of Kosovo to area descriptions impacts MGI (Ferro), MGI 1901, Trieste, pan-European and global CRSs. Change of area code removes Kosovo from SREF98, SRB_ETRS89 and SRB_VRS12 systems.','Added areas 4542-43, datum 1251, CRSs 9138-41 and transformations 9142-44. For areas 1298, 1321, 1711, 2066, 2370, 2830 and 2881, added Kosovo to description. For area 3534 changed name and description. For datums 1034, 1214 and 1216, CRSs 4073-75, 8682-85 and 8691 and transformations 4076-77, 7676 and 8893-94, changed area code from 3534 to 4543. For transformation 7675, added alias and changed area code from 3534 to 4543.'),
(2019.043,'2019-05-27','2019-07-17','Thierry Gattacceca; IGN','Add France overseas territories vertical data','Coordinate Operation','4566 5212 5618 5502-08','','Added datum 1250, CRS 9130 and transformations 9131-37 and 9187-88. For transformations 5502-06 and 5508, added supersession trail. For transformations 4566, 5212, 5507 and 5618, amended remarks.'),
