(4269,'NAD83',1350,'geographic 2D',6422,6269,Null,Null,Null,Null,'Geodetic survey.','Longitude is POSITIVE EAST. The adjustment included connections to Greenland and Mexico but the system was not adopted there. For applications with an accuracy of better than 1m replaced by NAD83(HARN) in the US and PRVI and by NAD83(CSRS) in Canada.','','IOGP','2018-09-27','2003.370 2006.464 2006.903 2018.056',true,false),
