(4304,'Voirol 1875',1365,'geographic 2D',6422,6304,Null,Null,Null,Null,'Geodetic survey.','The appropriate usage of CRSs using the Voirol 1875 and 1879 datums is lost in antiquity. They differ by about 9 metres. Oil industry references to one could in reality be to either. All replaced by Nord Sahara 1959 (CRS code 4307).','IGN Paris','OGP','2004-01-06','2003.361 2003.370',true,false),
