(4307,'Nord Sahara 1959',1026,'geographic 2D',6422,6307,Null,Null,Null,Null,'Geodetic survey.','Sometimes incorrectly referred to as Voirol Unifie 1960: this is NOT a GeogCRS but two projected CRSs based on Nord Sahara 1959 (codes 30791-92). Strictly applicable only to north of 32°N but extended southwards non-homogoneously by oil industry.','"Le System Geodesique Nord-Sahara"; IGN Paris','OGP','2012-04-18','2000.470 2002.560 2003.370 2009.106 2011.111',true,false),
