(9141,'KOSOVAREF01 / Balkans zone 7',4542,'projected',4400,Null,9140,18277,Null,Null,'Large and medium scale topographic mapping, cadastre and engineering survey.','Replaces MGI 1901 / Balkans zone 7 (CRS code 6316) in Kosovo. To differentiate old from new, coordinates in KOSOVAREF01 / Balkans zone 7 may be abbrevated as EK, NK where K is subscripted.','Kosovo Cadastral Agency (KCA), "Instructions for Cadastral Surveying including GNSS-Technologies".','IOGP','2019-07-16','2019.042',true,false);
