(6973,'PSAD56 to WGS 84 (17)','transformation',4248,4326,'NGA-Chl S 2014',17,4221,'For military purposes. Accuracy 10m in each axis.',17,9603,Null,Null,'Derived at 6 stations. Replaces PSAD56 to WGS 84 (4) (code 1204). Info source gives S limit as 44°S but Chilean IGM states that PSAD56 limit is 43°30''S. Also used as a transformation from PSAD56 to SIRGAS-Chile - see code 6951.','U.S. National Geospatial Intelligence Agency (NGA) Standard 0036 v1.0.0 of 2014-07-08.','OGP','2014-11-07','2014.082',true,false),
