(8452,'Padang to WGS 84 (1)','transformation',4280,4326,'DMA-Idn Sumatra',1,1355,'For military purposes. Accuracy 3m in each axis.',6,9603,Null,Null,'Note: U.S. Defense Mapping Agency TR8350.2 September 1987 gives source CRS as Batavia and area as Sumatra. The Batavia (Genuk) CRS applies to Java, not Sumatra. EPSG presumes the source CRS should be Padang. Derived at 5 stations.','IOGP based on U.S. Defense Mapping Agency TR8350.2 September 1987.','IOGP','2018-02-15','2018.007',true,false),
