(5117,'Rikets hojdsystem 1970','vertical','Adjustment is referenced to mean high tide at Amsterdams Peil in 1684. To account for land level movements caused by isostatic rebound, heights are reduced to epoch 1970.0 using uplift values computed from repeated levelling observations.','1970-01-01',Null,Null,3313,'Topographic mapping, geodetic survey.','Realized through the second precise levelling network of 1951-1967. Uses Normal heights. Replaces RH00. Replaced in 2005 by RH2000.','National Land Survey of Sweden','IOGP','2017-07-14','2002.480 2004.100 2008.013 2017.029',false),
